@startuml information-flow
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  BorderColor #334155
  DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
  DiamondBorderColor #B45309
  ArrowColor #475569
}

title Solveur Magique (V1.0.0) — End-to-End Scheduling Information Flow

|Manager / Staff Input|
start
:Define Team & Swiss Canton\n(Auto-load Public Holidays);
:Define Discrete Shift Templates\n(ERP Codes: MC1, M, S, N, Split Shifts, Breaks);
:Define Daily Coverage Targets\n(Weekday / Weekend / Holiday headcounts);
:Select Swiss Legal Preset\n(LTr / OLT 2 / L-GAV / Custom CCT);
:Enter Staff Profiles\n(Pseudonym or Name, % Pensum, Carry-over Solde,\nMonthly ±10h Corridor, Doublure Pairs);

fork
  :Manager enters Hard Absences\n(Vacations V + Auto Weekend Buffers,\nFixed SDE Team Meetings);
fork again
  :Collect Unlimited Soft Preferences\n(Manager-entered or Pro-Tier Employee Portal,\nWeighted by Rolling Multi-Month Equity);
end fork

|Validation & Privacy Gate|
:Validate Structural Integrity\n(Break Thresholds, Valid Codes, Tier Quotas);
:Enforce nLPD Privacy Rules\n(Pseudonymized in Sandbox; Zero Medical Free-Text);
:Build Immutable Problem Snapshot (JSON);

|Async CP-SAT Optimization Engine|
:Enqueue SolverJob in Redis\n(Tier Timeout: 5s / 15s / 30s);
:Construct Discrete CP-SAT Model\n(Binary vars x[e,d,s], Hard Legal/Coverage/Pinned,\nOptional Pouliste Slack, Soft Fairness Objective);
:Execute Google OR-Tools CP-SAT Solver;

if (Feasible Solution Found?) then (Yes)
  :Compute KPIs\n(Wish Satisfaction %, Projected Solde d'heures,\nPouliste Open Slots, 0 Legal Violations);
  :Persist Draft Schedule Snapshot;
else (No - INFEASIBLE)
  :Run SufficientAssumptionsForInfeasibility\nExtract Minimal Conflicting Constraints;
  :Translate to Plain-Language Conflict Cards\n(Exact Staff, Dates & Violated Rule);
  |Manager / Staff Input|
  :Review Conflict Cards & Choose Resolution\n(Allow Pouliste Slot / Widen Tolerance / Unpin);
  detach
endif

|Human-in-the-Loop Grid Review|
:Display ERP-Familiar Monthly Matrix Grid\n(Staff Rows, Day Cols, Weekend/Holiday Shading,\nFooter Daily Headcount & Hours, Running Hour Deltas);

if (Manual Adjustments / Pinning Needed?) then (Yes)
  :Edit Cells & Toggle Cell Pins (Lock);
  :Run Instant Rule & Double-Booking Check;
  :Trigger Partial Re-Solve on Unlocked Cells;
  |Async CP-SAT Optimization Engine|
  :Re-Optimize Preserving Pinned Assignments;
  detach
else (No - Approved)
  |Human-in-the-Loop Grid Review|
  :Finalize & Publish Month;
endif

|Export Engine & Archival|
:Persist Final Snapshot (5-Yr Archive on Business)\n& Roll Forward Ending Solde d'heures + Equity Score;
fork
  :Generate ERP-Mapped Excel (.xlsx)\n- Styled Matrix Sheet (MC1, V, X, SDE)\n- Flat Import Sheet\n- Pouliste Gap List;
fork again
  :Generate CSV (Generic / Bexio / Abacus / Crésus);
fork again
  :Generate Printable PDF & Employee iCal (.ics);
end fork

|Legacy ERP (External)|
:Manager Transcribes Clean Grid\nor Imports Excel/CSV into Legacy ERP;
stop

@enduml
